      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Clinical features of different headache syndromes have been described in great detail; however, its pathophysiology remains poorly understood. We review the latest findings in both human imaging studies and experimental animals to explain the possible mechanisms involved in the genesis of headache syndromes."},
